            <ArticleTitle>The clinical significance of the communicating branches of the somatic sensory supply of the middle and external ear.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1141-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The sensory supply of the middle and external ear is complicated by multiple neural communications. The anatomy of these communications and their clinical significance will be described in this paper.</AbstractText>
